  "columns": [
    {
      "column": "2L08",
      "pdf_page": 2,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "1上",
      "column_from_right": 8,
      "text": "子頊殷貴妃生始平孝敬王子鸞次永嘉王子仁與",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=2"
    },
    {
      "column": "3R01",
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "1下",
      "column_from_right": 1,
      "text": "王子羽與始平孝敬王子鸞同生江美人生皇子衡",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=3"
    },
    {
      "column": "3R03",
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "1下",
      "column_from_right": 3,
      "text": "次南平王子產與永嘉王子仁同生次晉陵孝王子雲",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=3"
    },
    {
      "column": "3R04",
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "1下",
      "column_from_right": 4,
      "text": "次皇子子文並與始平孝敬王子鸞同生次廬陵王子",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=3"
    },
    {
      "column": "3R05",
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "1下",
      "column_from_right": 5,
      "text": "輿與淮南王子孟同生次南海哀王子師與始平孝敬",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=3"
    },
    {
      "column": "3R06",
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "1下",
      "column_from_right": 6,
      "text": "王子鸞同生淮陽思王子霄與皇子子玄同生次皇子",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=3"
    },
    {
      "column": "7L09",
      "pdf_page": 7,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "6上",
      "column_from_right": 9,
      "text": "始平孝敬王子鸞字孝羽孝武帝第八子也大明四年",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7"
    },
    {
      "column": "7L10",
      "pdf_page": 7,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "6上",
      "column_from_right": 10,
      "text": "年五歲封襄陽王食邑二千戶仍為東中郎將吳郡太",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7"
    },
    {
      "column": "8R01",
      "pdf_page": 8,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "6下",
      "column_from_right": 1,
      "text": "守其年改封新安王戶邑如先五年遷北中郎將南徐",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=8"
    },
    {
      "column": "8R02",
      "pdf_page": 8,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "6下",
      "column_from_right": 2,
      "text": "州刺史領南琅邪太守母殷淑儀寵傾後宮子鸞愛冠",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=8"
    },
    {
      "column": "8R03",
      "pdf_page": 8,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "6下",
      "column_from_right": 3,
      "text": "諸子凡為上所盼遇者莫不入子鸞之府國及為南徐",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=8"
    },
    {
      "column": "8R04",
      "pdf_page": 8,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "6下",
      "column_from_right": 4,
      "text": "州又割吳都以屬之六年丁母憂追進淑儀為貴妃班",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=8"
    },
    {
      "column": "8R05",
      "pdf_page": 8,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "6下",
      "column_from_right": 5,
      "text": "亞皇后諡曰宣葬給",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=8"
    },
    {
      "column": "9L02",
      "pdf_page": 9,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "8上",
      "column_from_right": 2,
      "text": "貴於庶邦夫人據春秋傳仲子非魯惠公之元嫡尚得",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=9"
    },
    {
      "column": "9L03",
      "pdf_page": 9,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "8上",
      "column_from_right": 3,
      "text": "考彼別宮今貴妃蓋天秩之崇班理應創立新廟尚書",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=9"
    },
    {
      "column": "9L04",
      "pdf_page": 9,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "8上",
      "column_from_right": 4,
      "text": "左丞徐爰之又議宣貴妃既加殊命禮絕五宮考之古",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=9"
    },
    {
      "column": "9L09",
      "pdf_page": 9,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "8上",
      "column_from_right": 9,
      "text": "疾子鸞有寵既誅羣公乃遣使賜死時年十歲子鸞臨",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=9"
    },
    {
      "column": "9L10",
      "pdf_page": 9,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "8上",
      "column_from_right": 10,
      "text": "死謂左右曰願身不復生王家同生弟妹並死仍葬京",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=9"
    },
    {
      "column": "10R01",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "8下",
      "column_from_right": 1,
      "text": "口太宗即位詔曰夫紓寃申痛雖往必追緣情惻愛感",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=10"
    },
    {
      "column": "10R06",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "8下",
      "column_from_right": 6,
      "text": "諸軍事司徒南徐州刺史王如故第十二皇女第二皇",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=10"
    },
    {
      "column": "10R07",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "8下",
      "column_from_right": 7,
      "text": "子子師俱嬰謬酷有增酸悼皇女可贈縣公主子師復",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=10"
    },
    {
      "column": "10R08",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "8下",
      "column_from_right": 8,
      "text": "先封為南海王並加徽諡又曰哀枉追遠仁道所弘興",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=10"
    },
    {
      "column": "10L03",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "9上",
      "column_from_right": 3,
      "text": "祀莫寄尋念痛悼夙軫于懷可以建平王景素息延年",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=10"
    },
    {
      "column": "10L04",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "9上",
      "column_from_right": 4,
      "text": "為嗣追改子鸞封為始平王食邑千戶改葬秣陵縣龍",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=10"
    },
    {
      "column": "10L05",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "9上",
      "column_from_right": 5,
      "text": "山延年字德沖泰始四年薨時年四歲諡曰沖王明年",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=10"
    },
    {
      "column": "10L06",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "9上",
      "column_from_right": 6,
      "text": "復以長沙王纂子延之為始平王紹子鸞後順帝昇明",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=10"
    },
    {
      "column": "10L07",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "9上",
      "column_from_right": 7,
      "text": "三年薨國除",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/NLC892-411999017142-12317_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC151%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=10"
    }
  ],
